{"4183060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slime Slinger", "steam_appid": 4183060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slime Slinger</strong> is a 3rd Person action adventure game that combines classic western themes with an eye catching sci-fi style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> - Traverse diverse biomes ranging from molten tunnels to icy ridges and high tech labs. As a slime, your unique sliminess lets you access hidden routes, infiltrate tight spaces and discover DNA rich secrets that reward your curiosity. Exploration isn’t just optional it’s how you grow stronger and uncover the truth behind Dr. M’s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/4ba70be81917b41ac801d698cc52f3b4.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/4ba70be81917b41ac801d698cc52f3b4.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/4ba70be81917b41ac801d698cc52f3b4.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> - is fast, fluid and delightfully chaotic. Use Slime Shot to pepper enemies from range, close the gap with a crushing Slam and chain your evolving abilities into unpredictable combos. As you absorb new DNA your attacks morph in power and style letting you overwhelm the Dastardly Five’s minions in ways only a shape shifting slime can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/91139a77167097cd8bdeb18ca5e0edac.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/91139a77167097cd8bdeb18ca5e0edac.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/91139a77167097cd8bdeb18ca5e0edac.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong> - Your evolution is driven by a dedicated skill tree that upgrades your core abilities. Spend DNA to power up your Slam, extend the reach and speed of your Grapple Hook, and unlock enhanced variants of your slime techniques. Each upgrade makes your toolkit deadlier, faster, and more fun to experiment with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/fec53ff853fc67fbecc9e51970a51f08.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/fec53ff853fc67fbecc9e51970a51f08.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/fec53ff853fc67fbecc9e51970a51f08.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong> - Born in a lab and raised by Dr. M, you’ve only known one person who saw you as more than an experiment. When she’s kidnapped by the rogue outlaw gang known as the Dastardly Five, you break free from your incubator and set out across an unknown cavern. Following their slime tainted trail, you uncover the origins of your creation and the larger plan that threatens both humans and slimes alike. Not to mention a high stakes showdown waiting at the end of the trail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/d16832b7dbd684c6fd22aaa0f1ff68f0.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/d16832b7dbd684c6fd22aaa0f1ff68f0.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/d16832b7dbd684c6fd22aaa0f1ff68f0.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slime Slinger</strong> is a 3rd Person action adventure game that combines classic western themes with an eye catching sci-fi style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> - Traverse diverse biomes ranging from molten tunnels to icy ridges and high tech labs. As a slime, your unique sliminess lets you access hidden routes, infiltrate tight spaces and discover DNA rich secrets that reward your curiosity. Exploration isn’t just optional it’s how you grow stronger and uncover the truth behind Dr. M’s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/4ba70be81917b41ac801d698cc52f3b4.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/4ba70be81917b41ac801d698cc52f3b4.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/4ba70be81917b41ac801d698cc52f3b4.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> - is fast, fluid and delightfully chaotic. Use Slime Shot to pepper enemies from range, close the gap with a crushing Slam and chain your evolving abilities into unpredictable combos. As you absorb new DNA your attacks morph in power and style letting you overwhelm the Dastardly Five’s minions in ways only a shape shifting slime can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/91139a77167097cd8bdeb18ca5e0edac.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/91139a77167097cd8bdeb18ca5e0edac.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/91139a77167097cd8bdeb18ca5e0edac.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong> - Your evolution is driven by a dedicated skill tree that upgrades your core abilities. Spend DNA to power up your Slam, extend the reach and speed of your Grapple Hook, and unlock enhanced variants of your slime techniques. Each upgrade makes your toolkit deadlier, faster, and more fun to experiment with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/fec53ff853fc67fbecc9e51970a51f08.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/fec53ff853fc67fbecc9e51970a51f08.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/fec53ff853fc67fbecc9e51970a51f08.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong> - Born in a lab and raised by Dr. M, you’ve only known one person who saw you as more than an experiment. When she’s kidnapped by the rogue outlaw gang known as the Dastardly Five, you break free from your incubator and set out across an unknown cavern. Following their slime tainted trail, you uncover the origins of your creation and the larger plan that threatens both humans and slimes alike. Not to mention a high stakes showdown waiting at the end of the trail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/d16832b7dbd684c6fd22aaa0f1ff68f0.poster.avif?t=1785945849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/d16832b7dbd684c6fd22aaa0f1ff68f0.webm?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183060/extras/d16832b7dbd684c6fd22aaa0f1ff68f0.mp4?t=1785945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Escape the lab and begin your quest for the only human who ever cared about you. You play as an experimental slime created by Dr Maisel a brilliant scientist now kidnapped by The Da